  "description": "在飞书里发一条消息，自动同步发布到微博、即刻、豆瓣（Cross-post a single Feishu message to Weibo, Jike and Douban）",
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/qishuai6/feishu-crosspost.git"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "feishu",
